  "id": "wither-dispenser-base-pattern",
  "title": "Dispensers build the Wither skull row from an unfinished base",
  "category": "entities",
  "description": "A loaded creative observer watches three north-facing dispensers place Wither skulls on a soul-block T. Each case begins with an unpowered dispenser row; power each dispenser separately and verify first, second and final placement, item consumption and summoning. Peaceful, missing-arm, occupied-target and wrong-skull controls retain the expected blocks and items.",
